{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_016_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4652afc7771a38572f46a20db16bb1f423d0a71cb02b7c81636a32b51504f158",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:919789812201459dd0c6009dbcaeeb0b0dc1e4b69a35f0b2349087404a372139",
      "text": "好，差不多可以了。来读邀请函吧。\n……这真是力作啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:740a9428ca00daae06ba47f1c0226db294df5c540162a47c455b440891726a79",
      "text": "是的呢。举办地点是诚司先生家，\n时间写着是在诚司先生生日的前几天呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8faea72e31971ffbae2d83626b8da95fe2ca537fbbd91e3c156f5e91e3a25f02",
      "text": "这样啊——\n诚司先生生日当天排了工作嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4ad55f10c18395ce536e79ab226e84bfc218261d40096e16b6f1c0820e43c7d",
      "text": "要带的东西是……送给诚司先生的礼物，\n还有生日会的装饰品吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e35c8cb0b35192c84aa0210be2d7e6bee2eb87ef88f72ca3ae21c908734b2e84",
      "text": "信上也写了信玄提过的蛋糕的事呢。\n还说“敬请期待”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0879a7c85589b58cb8b535b31fd9392a8731b9d98eff6de3aaf095813dc4c683",
      "text": "说起来，之前诚司先生问过我这几天的日程安排呢——原来是为了这个啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0507d1ac8b9be6befe31811a3cb2dd3407c0317750fe618c20dcb5cb548dc910",
      "text": "我也被问了。大概是受天音酱所托吧。\n制作人也被问过了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a5fd9e15607b4a3b55f60fef05fcea2a78883472753237956a9c80ae480efd0",
      "text": "是的。这一天我已经空出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_016sei_02_1_2_016_02:1_2_016_02_c:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31bd57c9caaf9d265a11c9c4a0e7d89df378068a3b06770b5a901dc97b6d1e5c",
      "text": "那在场的各位都要参加呢。\n各自去回复一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
